        <mxCell id="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-133" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: raavi; font-size: 15px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;ਪਿਆਰੇ ਭਾਈ ਹਿੰਮਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Garamond&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;|&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Pyare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Bhai Himmat Singh Ji&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;(1661 - 1705)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#062B70;fillStyle=solid;glass=0;shadow=0;align=left;strokeColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2290" y="2541" width="440" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-134" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: raavi; font-size: 15px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;ਪਿਆਰੇ ਭਾਈ ਮੋਹਕਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Garamond&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;|&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Pyare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Bhai Mohkam Singh Ji&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;(1663 - 1705)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#062B70;fillStyle=solid;glass=0;shadow=0;align=left;strokeColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-1" vertex="1">
