        <mxCell id="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-135" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: raavi; font-size: 15px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;ਪਿਆਰੇ ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Garamond&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;|&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Pyare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Bhai Sahib Singh Ji&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;(1662 - 1705)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#062B70;fillStyle=solid;glass=0;shadow=0;align=left;strokeColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="CTDWZ7_SoCDcn1SdTo_g-1" vertex="1">
