        <mxCell id="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-317" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਸੰਤੋਖਸਰ ਦੀ ਖੁਦਵਾਈ ਅਰੰਭੀ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;| Digging&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; started of &#39;Santokh-sar&#39; (1570)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &#39;ਗੁਰੂ ਕਾ ਚੱਕ&#39; ਵਸਾਇਆ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Established &#39;Guru Ka Chak&#39; (1572)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ਅੰਮ੍ਰਿਤਸਰ ਸਰੋਵਰ ਦੀ ਤਿਆਰੀ ਅਰੰਭੀ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Planning of Amritsar Sarovar (1577)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚੰਦ ਜੀ ਨਾਲ ਮੇਲ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma;&quot;&gt;Meeting with Baba Sri Chand Ji&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#8EBBFF;fillStyle=solid;align=left;strokeColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#0F0F0F;" parent="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-1" vertex="1">
