        <mxCell id="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-319" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅੰਗਦ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ ਦੀ ਸੇਵਾ ਵਿੱਚ |&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;Service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;to Sri&amp;nbsp;Guru Angad Dev Ji&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;(1541-1552)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਗੋਇੰਦਵਾਲ ਵਸਾਇਆ |&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 14px; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;Established Goindwal (1549)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਬਾਉਲੀ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਦੀ ਉਸਾਰੀ &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent; font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;| Bowli Sahib&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent; font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Construction (1559 - 1564)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#AECFFF;fillStyle=solid;align=left;strokeColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 1;fontColor=#0E0E0E;" parent="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-1" vertex="1">
