        <mxCell id="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-320" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਹਰਿਮੰਦਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਦੀ ਨੀਂਹ &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;| Foundation of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Harmandir Sahib (1589)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਤਰਨ ਤਾਰਨ ਵਸਾਇਆ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;| Established&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Taran Taaran (1596)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;raavi&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ਆਦਿ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਜੀ ਦੀ ਬੀੜ ਤਿਆਰ ਹੋੇਈ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;| Aad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Tahoma; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Granth Ji completed (1604)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#6AA3FF;fillStyle=solid;align=left;strokeColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="g3HBGPiKNj88gW24iFQD-1" vertex="1">
